{"audio": "revelation-08.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 117733, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 2400, "text": "Revelation, Chapter Eight."}, {"start_ms": 2400, "end_ms": 7733, "text": "And when he had opened the seventh seal, there was silence in heaven about the space of half an hour."}, {"start_ms": 7733, "end_ms": 13333, "text": "And I saw the seven angels which stood before God; and to them were given seven trumpets."}, {"start_ms": 13333, "end_ms": 25200, "text": "And another angel came and stood at the altar, having a golden censer; and there was given unto him much incense, that he should offer it with the prayers of all saints upon the golden altar which was before the throne."}, {"start_ms": 25200, "end_ms": 31200, "text": "And the smoke of the incense, which came with the prayers of the saints, ascended up before God out of the angel's hand."}, {"start_ms": 31200, "end_ms": 40933, "text": "And the angel took the censer, and filled it with fire of the altar, and cast it into the earth: and there were voices, and thunderings, and lightnings, and an earthquake."}, {"start_ms": 40933, "end_ms": 45600, "text": "And the seven angels which had the seven trumpets prepared themselves to sound."}, {"start_ms": 45600, "end_ms": 57600, "text": "The first angel sounded, and there followed hail and fire mingled with blood, and they were cast upon the earth: and the third part of trees was burnt up, and all green grass was burnt up."}, {"start_ms": 57600, "end_ms": 71600, "text": "And the second angel sounded, and as it were a great mountain burning with fire was cast into the sea: and the third part of the sea became blood; And the third part of the creatures which were in the sea, and had life, died; and the third part of the ships were destroyed."}, {"start_ms": 71600, "end_ms": 87333, "text": "And the third angel sounded, and there fell a great star from heaven, burning as it were a lamp, and it fell upon the third part of the rivers, and upon the fountains of waters; And the name of the star is called Wormwood: and the third part of the waters became wormwood;"}, {"start_ms": 87333, "end_ms": 90933, "text": "and many men died of the waters, because they were made bitter."}, {"start_ms": 90933, "end_ms": 105600, "text": "And the fourth angel sounded, and the third part of the sun was smitten, and the third part of the moon, and the third part of the stars; so as the third part of them was darkened, and the day shone not for a third part of it, and the night likewise."}, {"start_ms": 105600, "end_ms": 117733, "text": "And I beheld, and heard an angel flying through the midst of heaven, saying with a loud voice, Woe, woe, woe, to the inhabiters of the earth by reason of the other voices of the trumpet of the three angels, which are yet to sound!"}], "words": [{"t": "Revelation,", "s": 545, "e": 1150, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 1533, "e": 1936, "si": 0}, {"t": "Eight.", "s": 2118, "e": 2259, "si": 0}, {"t": "And", "s": 3202, "e": 3282, "si": 1}, {"t": "when", "s": 3302, "e": 3422, "si": 1}, {"t": "he", "s": 3443, "e": 3503, "si": 1}, {"t": "had", "s": 3523, "e": 3623, "si": 1}, {"t": "opened", "s": 3683, "e": 3944, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 3964, "e": 4044, "si": 1}, {"t": "seventh", "s": 4124, "e": 4465, "si": 1}, {"t": "seal,", "s": 4565, "e": 4806, "si": 1}, {"t": "there", "s": 4866, "e": 4986, "si": 1}, {"t": "was", "s": 4986, "e": 5107, "si": 1}, {"t": "silence", "s": 5207, "e": 5648, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 5668, "e": 5728, "si": 1}, {"t": "heaven", "s": 5788, "e": 6029, "si": 1}, {"t": "about", "s": 6069, "e": 6269, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 6289, "e": 6370, "si": 1}, {"t": "space", "s": 6430, "e": 6751, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 6791, "e": 6851, "si": 1}, {"t": "half", "s": 6911, "e": 7091, "si": 1}, {"t": "an", "s": 7152, "e": 7212, "si": 1}, {"t": "hour.", "s": 7252, "e": 7533, "si": 1}, {"t": "And", "s": 8235, "e": 8315, "si": 2}, {"t": "I", "s": 8395, "e": 8415, "si": 2}, {"t": "saw", "s":